    "body": "I ran the sample code provided, but the last line is not output in the latest version.\n```\nimport logUpdate from 'log-update';\n\nconst frames = ['-', '\\\\', '|', '/'];\nlet index = 0;\n\nsetInterval(() => {\n\tconst frame = frames[index = ++index % frames.length];\n\n\tlogUpdate(\n`\n        ♥♥\n   ${frame} unicorns ${frame}\n        ♥♥\n`\n\t);\n}, 80);\n```\n\nv7.0.1\n```\n>tsx src.ts\n\n        ♥♥\n   \\ unicorns \\\n```\n\n\nv6.1.0\n\n```\n>tsx src.ts\n\n        ♥♥\n   \\ unicorns \\\n        ♥♥\n```",
